{"sourceUrl":"https://mkszyxy.cug.edu.cn/info/1039/10658.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:31.484149+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mkszyxy.cug.edu.cn/info/1039/10658.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>  根据《中国地质大学</span><span>（</span><span>武汉</span><span>）</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span><span>接收</span><span>推免</span><span>生</span><span>招</span><span>生</span><span>录取</span><span>工作</span><span>办法</span><span>》</span><span>（</span><span><span>地大研发〔</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>〕</span><span>5</span><span>0</span><span>号</span><span>）</span><span>文件精神，为做好</span><span>我院</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span><span>接收</span><span>推免</span><span>生</span><span>招</span><span>生</span><span>录取工作，</span><span>特制定本办法</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>一、指导思想</span></p><p><span>我院</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>接收</span><span>推免</span><span>生</span><span>招生</span><span>录取</span><span>工作</span><span>围绕落实立德树人根本任务</span><span>，</span><span>以提高质量为核心，</span><span><span>坚持</span></span><span>科学、规范、公平的原则，</span><span><span>以德为先、全面衡量、择优选拔</span></span><span>，</span><span>不断加强监督管理，切实严明招生纪律，</span><span>着力</span><span>选拔</span><span>培养</span><span>拔尖</span><span>创新</span><span>人才</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>二、接收推免生学科专业及</span><span>招生</span><span>计划</span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>接收</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>推免</span></strong><strong><span>生</span></strong><strong><span>类型</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>接收</span></strong><strong><span>推免生</span></strong><strong><span>计划数</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>030500</span></p></td><td><p><span>马克思主义理论</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span><span>4</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0</span><span>40</span><span>200</span></p></td><td><p><span>心理学</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>6</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span>三、申请条件</span></p><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党</span><span>领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.具有推荐免试资格高校的应届本科毕业生，并获得所在院校推荐免试资格，推荐手续完备，材料齐全。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.本科在校期间学习成绩优异，诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>四、接收程序</span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span>8<span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日，学校已开启推免生预报名工作</span></span><span>，</span><span>具有推荐免试资格的申请考生</span><span>均可</span><span>报名</span><span>。</span><span>所有正式报名工作均需在研招网推免系统完成</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.提交申请材料。</span><span>申请考生请于</span><strong><span>9月</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>晚</span></strong><strong><span>上</span></strong><strong><span>20</span></strong><strong><span>:00</span></strong><span>前</span><span><span>提交个人简历</span><span>pdf（附件1）和支撑材料pdf文件（附件2），邮件主题为</span></span><span>“姓名-本科学校名称-申请专业名称”，申请材料</span><span>请</span><span>考生</span><span>们</span><span>分成两个附件</span><span>。</span><span>马克思</span><span>主义理论</span><span>专业</span><span>材料</span><span>提交至邮箱：</span><span>yjs19@cug.edu.cn</span><span>；</span><span>心理学</span><span>专业</span><span>材料</span><span>提交</span><span>至</span><span>邮箱</span><span>：</span><a href=\"mailto:qinyang@cug.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>qinyang@cug.edu.cn</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>1）</span><span>附件</span><span>1</span><span>-</span><span><span>个人简历（</span><span>pdf 文档，文件名为“个人简历-姓名-申请专业名称”）。内容包括个人基本信息、学习经历、工作经历、科研经历，大学成绩绩点或排名，如有挂科必须注明，获奖、科研成果等情况。控制在1-2 个页面</span></span><span>，</span><span>因为学院收到简历后，所有考生的简历会单独打印成册</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>2）</span><span><span>附件</span><span>2-</span></span><span><span>支撑材料（</span><span>pdf文档，文件名为“支撑材料-姓名-申请专业名称”）。包括：①二代居民身份证、学生证原件扫描件；②历年在校学习成绩单原件(盖推荐院校教务部门公章)扫描件；③其他各种能力证明材料(如大学英语四、六级考试成绩单、获奖证书、学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等)扫描件。</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>材料审查</span><span>评议</span><span>。</span><span>我院</span><span>对申</span><span>请考生的材料进行审查、评议，确定复试名单</span><span>，</span><span>分批向申请考生发出复试通知</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>报名</span><span>并</span><span>参加</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span>。</span><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><span>研招网</span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>开通推免生报名功能，</span></span><span><span>推免生正式开始网上报名。</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>8:00</span></span></strong><span>开始</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>我院</span><span>开始</span><span><span>发送复试通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span>请考生注意及时接收复试通知</span><span><span>。</span></span><span>我院</span><span>将</span><span>通过</span><span>线上</span><span>形式</span><span>多批次</span><span>灵活</span><span>组织</span><span>开展</span><span>综合考核</span><span>，</span><span>请</span><span>考生</span><span>按时</span><span>参加</span><span>。</span><span>具体</span><span>时间</span><span>和</span><span>综合考核</span><span>安排</span><span>另行</span><span>通知</span><span>。</span><strong><span>已报名</span></strong><span>考</span><span>生</span><span>请</span><span>注意</span><span>及时</span><span>接收</span><span>相关</span><span>通知</span><span>并</span><span>按</span><span>要求</span><span>参加</span><span>综合考核</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>5.完成</span><span>录取手续。</span><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>8:00</span></span></strong><span>开始</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>我院</span><span>通过</span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>发送待录取通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>14:00</span></span></strong><strong> </strong><span>开始</span><span>，</span><span>请</span><span>考生</span><span>及时</span><span>接收</span><span>待录取通知</span><span>。</span><span>接收待录取通知的申请考生名单经公示无异议后列入正式录取名单，不再参加统考。</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>网报期间</span></span><span>，</span><span>我院</span><span>将</span><span>根</span><span>据</span><span>报名情况</span><span>适时</span><span><span>及时组织</span></span><span>综合考核和</span><span><span>录取</span></span><span>工作</span><span><span>。</span></span><span>请考</span><span>生</span><span>保持</span><span>电话</span><span>畅通。</span></p><p><span>五、复试</span><span>录取</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.资格审核</span><span>。</span><span>我院</span><span>依据</span><span>材料</span><span>严格核对考生的</span><span>申请信息</span><span></span><span>，按接收条件严格审查申请考生的申请资格。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.复试形式</span><span>。</span><span>我院</span><span>采取</span><span>线上</span> <span>方式进行复试</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>复试时间。我院根据报名情况适时组织，以邮件或电话形式通知相关考生，请考生务必保持邮件和电话畅通。</span><span><strong><span>第一批次复试时间预计为9月22日上午，复试考生名单将通过电子邮件形式通知</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.复试内容</span><span>。</span><span><span>综合面试，满分</span><span>100分。综合面试重点考察考生的专业素养、创新精神和创新能力、思想政治素质和 道德品质、实践能力、外语听说能力等。</span></span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span>成绩</span><span>。</span><span>成绩结果按</span><span>百分制评分，保留至</span><span>小数点后两位。</span><span>综合考核</span><span><span>成绩</span><span>=</span></span><span><span>综合面试成绩</span><span>*100%。</span></span></p><p><span>6</span><span>.录取规则</span><span>。</span><span>按照申请考生复试成绩排序确定拟录取名单。</span><span>综合考核</span><span>成绩不</span><span>合格</span><span>（</span><span>低于</span><span>60</span><span>分</span><span>）</span><span>不予录取</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>六</span><span>、</span><span>其他事项</span></p><p><span>1.申请考生必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，一旦发现申请考生提交的信息不真实或不准确，</span><span>我院</span><span>将不予录取或取消录取资格。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>复试名单、复试成绩及拟录取名单</span><span>在</span><span>我院</span><span>官</span><span>网公示。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>复试和拟录取</span><span>阶段不组织体检</span><span>，</span><span>拟录取的推免生参加新生入学体检。</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.</span><span>我校确定接收的推免生，在入学报到时未获得本科毕业证书者，学校将取消其录取资格。 </span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span>监督与申诉渠道</span><span>。</span><span><span>研究生院招生管理办公室：电话：</span><span>027-67885153，邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:yzb@cug.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>yzb@cug.edu.cn</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>6</span><span>.</span><span>联系方式</span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：湖北省武汉市洪山区鲁磨路</span><span>388号中国地质大学</span></span><span>（</span><span>武汉</span><span>）</span><span><span>马克思主义学院</span><span>B1001 办公室</span></span><span><span>，邮政编码：</span><span>430074         </span></span><span>联系人：钱老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>027-67848611</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>yjs19@cug.edu.cn</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>马克思主义</span><span>学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>1</span><span>6</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"7d67223c86f2a7678ace85acbf220d1b749ae79ab598085d55f6f735c764e600","textLength":1930,"sourceSha256":"987679d83bfd3b4d7c687d76167c550eeb3f66d5e3ce7ce331aaba90d9a69c08","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-170ead13803b32d52278","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）马克思主义学院2027年接收推免生招生录取工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:31.484149+00:00"}
